  "statement": "# Vaultline — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nBuild momentum through compact platforming rooms, link movement techniques into a continuous route, and finish a short speed-focused run.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA bounded 2D momentum-platformer with readable movement rules, progressive room challenges, fast failure recovery, and final completion.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the movement techniques, room topology, act structure, hazards, and timing goals.\n"
